this area's structure close to the original.  This is a stock zone and it will
help new players transition from another Circle to RavenMUD.  The point of the
edit?  Mainly filler and gives me some building experience without screwing up
an important area.    

Ver 1.1 done by Xiuhtecuhtli: started May 2006. Currently incomplete 

Original work done by Smythe: October 1996
